      "name": "Yonehara Beach & Coral Reef",
      "description": "A wild natural white-sand beach on northern Ishigaki where shallow coral reefs grow right up near the shore, making it a favorite spot for beachgoers and marine life watching.",
      "highlights": [
        "Snorkel directly off the white sand beach to view shallow colorful corals and clownfish",
        "Relax under green coastal trees along the tranquil shoreline"
      ],
